# Repo root hygiene

## Test output (never commit)

- **Only** `.artifacts/` (leading dot) holds Vitest coverage, Playwright traces, JUnit, and ad-hoc test logs.
- Run `pnpm artifacts:init` before tests; `pnpm artifacts:check` fails if output drifts outside `.artifacts/`.

## Do not create at repo root

| Forbidden | Use instead |
| --------- | ----------- |
| `artifacts/` (no dot) | `.artifacts/` for generated output; `docs/testing/` for committed audit baselines |
| `build-log.txt`, `*-snapshot.yml`, `page-*.yml` | `.artifacts/logs/` or delete after debugging |
| `test-results/`, `playwright-report/`, `coverage/` | `.artifacts/playwright/`, `.artifacts/coverage/` |

## Committed audit / design reports

- UI audit matrices and testing notes: `docs/testing/` (e.g. `ui-audit-matrix.md`)
- Primitive contracts: `packages/ui/audits/`

`pnpm architecture:check` enforces root hygiene. Cursor hook `guard-root-hygiene.mjs` blocks agent writes to forbidden root paths.
